WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.719
Zoom! Roxy shot toward the bus.

2
00:00:05.719 --> 00:00:08.645
"It's Rocket Girl!" cried Jack.

3
00:00:08.645 --> 00:00:12.943
"I can't believe Roxy is missing this!" said Terrell.

4
00:00:12.943 --> 00:00:17.248
"Hang on, everyone!" Roxy called to the scared passengers.

5
00:00:17.249 --> 00:00:20.708
Gripping the bus, Roxy flew up into the air.

6
00:00:20.708 --> 00:00:23.916
The Ultra Car zoomed by below her.

7
00:00:23.917 --> 00:00:26.222
"Whew!" said Roxy.

8
00:00:26.222 --> 00:00:29.334
Everyone on the bus cheered.

9
00:00:29.334 --> 00:00:34.743
Roxy carried the bus to its next stop. She set it down.

10
00:00:34.744 --> 00:00:37.652
"Thanks, Rocket Girl!" said the bus driver.

11
00:00:37.652 --> 00:00:39.959
"You're welcome!" called Roxy.

12
00:00:39.959 --> 00:00:42.322
She flew into the air again.

13
00:00:42.322 --> 00:00:45.698
"I have to stop the Ultra Car," she thought.

14
00:00:45.698 --> 00:00:49.307
"Ruby can't control it!"

15
00:00:49.307 --> 00:00:54.462
Suddenly— whoosh! The Ultra Car flew past Roxy.

16
00:00:54.462 --> 00:00:59.401
"Uh-oh!" cried Roxy. "I forgot that car could fly!"

17
00:00:59.401 --> 00:01:02.872
Roxy flew after the flying car.

18
00:01:02.873 --> 00:01:06.675
Ruby screamed. "Save me, Rocket Girl!"

19
00:01:06.676 --> 00:01:09.782
Ruby pressed buttons and flipped switches.

20
00:01:09.782 --> 00:01:11.573
But the car kept going.

21
00:01:11.573 --> 00:01:15.314
Zap! Zap! Lasers fired.

22
00:01:15.314 --> 00:01:18.128
Roxy dodged them.

23
00:01:18.128 --> 00:01:20.612
The Ultra Car dived down.

24
00:01:20.612 --> 00:01:24.024
Splash! It plunged into the river.

25
00:01:24.025 --> 00:01:26.781
Then the car popped out of the water.

26
00:01:26.781 --> 00:01:28.726
Now it was a boat!

27
00:01:28.726 --> 00:01:31.419
It glided fast over the water.

28
00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:34.329
Roxy flew fast too.

29
00:01:34.329 --> 00:01:36.934
She grabbed the car's roof.

30
00:01:36.934 --> 00:01:41.358
Roxy used her super strength to pull off the roof. Rip!

31
00:01:41.358 --> 00:01:44.064
"Yay!" shouted Ruby.

32
00:01:44.065 --> 00:01:46.725
Roxy pulled Ruby from the stolen car.

33
00:01:46.725 --> 00:01:50.065
Next Roxy used her heat vision.

34
00:01:50.066 --> 00:01:53.385
Orange beams melted the car's control panel.

35
00:01:53.386 --> 00:01:57.213
The Ultra Car slowed down and then bobbed in the water.

36
00:01:57.213 --> 00:02:00.945
Ruby grinned. "Thank you, Rocket Girl."

37
00:02:00.945 --> 00:02:05.173
Roxy frowned. "You caused a lot of damage, Ruby."

38
00:02:05.173 --> 00:02:09.579
"Did I?" Ruby glanced around.

39
00:02:09.579 --> 00:02:15.895
"Oh well. Mother will pay someone to fix everything."

40
00:02:15.895 --> 00:02:18.642
Roxy picked up the car with one hand.

41
00:02:18.642 --> 00:02:21.125
She carried Ruby with the other.

42
00:02:21.125 --> 00:02:25.992
She flew back to the car show.

43
00:02:25.993 --> 00:02:28.850
"Hello, Mother," said Ruby.

44
00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:31.545
"Your favorite daughter is safe.

45
00:02:31.545 --> 00:02:35.191
Rocket Girl was kind enough to save me."

46
00:02:35.192 --> 00:02:39.219
Mrs. Cash dabbed her eyes with the handkerchief again. "Thank

47
00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:47.412
you, Rocket Girl! Thank you for saving my daughter!" Later

48
00:02:47.413 --> 00:02:51.058
Roxy and her friends were at Mara's house. They

49
00:02:51.058 --> 00:02:53.862
were playing video games. ***

50
00:02:53.862 --> 00:02:57.730
"You missed all the fun today, Roxy," said Jack.

51
00:02:57.730 --> 00:03:01.899
"We flew through the air in a bus!" said Mara.

52
00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:04.257
Roxy pretended to be surprised.

53
00:03:04.257 --> 00:03:06.953
"Wow! How did that happen?"

54
00:03:06.954 --> 00:03:11.179
Terrell grinned. "Rocket Girl carried the bus through the air.

55
00:03:11.179 --> 00:03:14.462
I told you she could help us fly!"

56
00:03:14.462 --> 00:03:17.164
"It was awesome!"

57
00:03:17.164 --> 00:03:21.598
Jack threw up his hands and dropped his controller. "Oops!"

58
00:03:21.598 --> 00:03:25.197
Everyone laughed.

59
00:03:25.197 --> 00:03:32.132
"Good thing Rocket Girl didn't drop your bus!" said Roxy.

